  "summary": "可任意翻转二进制矩阵的整行或整列，把每行看成二进制数，求行数值总和最大值。",
  "insight": "最高位权重大于其余位总和，因此每行都应翻到首位为一；在此前提下，每列独立选择是否翻转，使该列一的数量最大。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "无需实际修改矩阵",
    "行 r 列 c 的有效值是 grid[r][c] xor grid[r][0]",
    "列权为 2^(columns-1-c)"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "virtual-row-flip-column-majority",
      "title": "虚拟行翻转与列多数",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "贪心固定最高位后逐列取多数值。",
      "steps": [
        "对每列统计 effectiveOne：grid[r][c] xor grid[r][0] 为零表示行翻后该位是一",
        "ones=max(count,rows-count)，对应选择是否翻列",
        "answer+=ones*(1<<(columns-1-c))"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(mn)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/virtual-row-flip-column-majority/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/virtual-row-flip-column-majority/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/virtual-row-flip-column-majority/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
